---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="mercurial" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Translation tool · sharing phases",
        "번역 도구 · 공유 단계",
        "翻訳ツール · 共有段階",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "The same change. A new sharing phase.",
        "같은 변경, 달라진 공유 단계",
        "同じ変更、新しい共有段階",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div class="phase" data-draft>
    <span class="stamp">draft</span>
    <div>
      <h3>
        {t(
          "01 / Local wording fix",
          "01 / 로컬 문구 수정",
          "01 / ローカルの文言修正",
        )}
      </h3>
      <p>
        <code>hg commit</code> ·{" "}
        {t(
          "Default new-commit phase",
          "기본 새 커밋 단계",
          "新コミットの既定の段階",
        )}
      </p>
      <p class="sample">
        {t(
          "Translation: clarify the Save label",
          "번역: 저장 문구 명확히 하기",
          "翻訳：保存の文言を明確にする",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="crossing" data-publishing>
    <b>
      02 / <code>hg push</code> ↓
    </b>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Remote configured as publishing",
        "publishing으로 설정된 원격",
        "publishingに設定されたリモート",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="phase public" data-public>
    <span class="stamp">public</span>
    <div>
      <h3>
        {t("03 / Shared history", "03 / 공유된 이력", "03 / 共有済みの履歴")}
      </h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Public on the local and remote repositories",
          "로컬과 원격 저장소 모두 public",
          "ローカルとリモートの両方でpublic",
        )}
      </p>
      <p class="sample">
        {t(
          "Same wording fix · check before rewriting",
          "같은 문구 수정 · 이력 수정 전 확인",
          "同じ文言修正 · 履歴編集の前に確認",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside data-alternative>
    <b>{t("Another configuration", "다른 설정", "別の設定")}</b>
    <p>
      <code>publish = False</code> →{" "}
      {t(
        "draft can stay draft when exchanged",
        "교환해도 draft 유지 가능",
        "交換してもdraftを保持可能",
      )}
    </p>
  </aside>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Public phase ≠ public access. These phases describe sharing history, not repository permissions.",
      "public 단계 ≠ 공개 접근. 공유 이력을 나타내는 단계이며 저장소 권한이 아닙니다.",
      "public段階 ≠ 一般公開。共有の履歴を表す段階であり、リポジトリの権限ではありません。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    background: #f3eff6;
    color: #48345b;
    border: 1px solid #9d8da9;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  header > p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .phase {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 130px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 2px dashed #776287;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .stamp {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-weight: 750;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 2px dashed;
    padding: 12px 4px;
  }
  .public {
    border: 3px solid #48345b;
  }
  .public .stamp {
    border-style: solid;
    background: #48345b;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .sample {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid #cfc3d9;
  }
  .crossing {
    margin: 0 0 0 85px;
    border-left: 4px solid #776287;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }
  .crossing p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  aside {
    border-left: 4px solid #776287;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    background: #e6dfee;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .boundary {
    border-top: 1px solid #9d8da9;
    padding-top: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  @container (max-width:480px) {
    .phase {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .stamp {
      justify-self: start;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
    .crossing {
      margin-left: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
